[00:17.95]1. To whom do you belong?
[00:22.17]Which god do you now obey?
[00:26.47]Your master’s the one to whom you bow.
[00:30.47]He is your god; you serve him now.
[00:35.27]You cannot serve two gods;
[00:39.27]Devotion cannot be shared.
[00:43.96]And so in the end your choice will depend
[00:49.39]On how your heart is prepared.
[00:54.81]2. To whom do you belong?
[00:58.81]Which god will you now obey?
[01:02.81]For one god is false and one is true,
[01:06.81]So make your choice; it’s up to you.
[01:11.81]Will Caesar of this world
[01:15.81]Possess your allegiance still?
[01:21.12]Or will you obey the true God today
[01:42.86]By always doing his will?
[02:04.60]3. To whom do I belong?
[02:12.60]Jehovah I will obey.
[02:15.60]My Father in heaven I will serve;
[02:18.60]I’ll pay my vows without reserve.
[02:22.36]He bought me at great cost;
[02:26.36]Devoted to him I’ll stay.
[02:30.36]To him I will give each moment I live.
[02:34.36]His name I’ll honor each day.